#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, templateEdit)
#: grepwidget.ui:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the regular expression template. <i>%s</i> will be replaced by the "
"pattern, while <i>%%</i> will be replaced by <i>%</i>."
